                    {readOk && noteTotals.saved > 0 && <p className="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-600"><b>{noteTotals.saved}</b> run{noteTotals.saved === 1 ? '' : 's'} carry notes from the sheet. {api.columnReport().refused[F_NOTES] ? `The Notes column is not in Dataverse yet, so they are ${lsOk ? 'kept in this browser only' : 'held only until this page is closed'} (see Data Check > Columns).` : "They are saved in the run's Notes column"} and shown on the Gantt (pencil) and in the Run dialog.</p>}
                    {notesLeft.length > 0 && (
                        <div className="mt-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#FFF6E0] border border-[#FFB81C]/60" data-testid="notes-left">
